&error_wrong_pass_text_allow_correctionpWachtwoord geweigerd. Wellicht is het wachtwoord op een ander apparaat gewijzigd. Vul het huidige wachtwoord in.error_character_already_added|<red>Dit personage is al toegevoegd op dit apparaat!</red><br><br>Klik op 'Terug' om terug te keren naar het selectiescherm.album_ach_083_text/Dobbel 5 keer hetzelfde icoon bij de goochelaarevent_description_blacksmith¸<li>Je kunt metaal en arcane splinters tijdens opdrachten vinden</li><li>%1 in plaats van %2 punten voor het ontmantelen van voorwerpen bij de smid</li><li>%3x arcane splinters bij de goochelaar</li><li>%4x arcane splinters bij het rad van fortuin</li>event_description_epic_gamble|<li>Kans op een episch voorwerp bij de goochelaar</li><li>Verhoogde kans op een episch voorwerp bij het rad van fortuin</li>event_description_fortressÛ<li>Je kunt hout en steen tijdens opdrachten vinden</li><li>Alleen grote juwelen in de juwelenmijn</li><li>Trainingsduur van eenheden gehalveerd</li><li>%1x hout en steen bij de goochelaar</li><li>%2x hout en steen bij het rad van fortuin</li>event_description_hourglassò<li>10x meer zandlopers in de toverwinkel</li><li>%1x zandlopers bij de goochelaar</li><li>Verzamel zandlopers bij opdrachten in zanderige gebieden</li>event_description_underworldˇ<li>Je kunt zielen tijdens opdrachten vinden</li><li>%1x zielen voor het lokken van helden naar je onderwereld</li><li>%2x zielen na het verzamelen bij de zielenextractor</li><li>%3x zielen bij de goochelaar</li><li>%4x zielen bij het rad van fortuin</li>class_info_5GFlings an Arcane Comet at the opponent at the beginning of each battle.old_game_worldsOld game worldsmax_pinned_battles_reached5The maximum number of pinned fights has been reached!earn_mushroomsEarn mushroomsbattle_mage_attack_infoKBefore each fight the Arcane Comet deals some extra damage to the opponent.battle_mage_info_comet_text¥The Arcane Comet deals damage to your enemy depending on your hit points and the class of your enemy. The resulting damage is never higher than %1% of your enemy's <hp> hit points.battle_mage_info_gauntlet_text≠At the start of the battle, your Arcane Gauntlet unleashes the power of the Arcane Comet that hits your enemy. The damage of this attack depends on your hit points and your enemy's class.<br><br>The Arcane Energy Flows strengthen your attributes by %1% and protect you especially well against attacks.bard_info_melody_text˛You play your harp every %1 combat rounds.<br><br>Your melody, however, will be ineffective in fights against <info>Mages</info><br><br>Your melody has 3 quality levels, depending on the quality level the positive effect of the melody is enhanced.<br>Chance for the respective quality levels:<br><li>Level 1: %2%</li><li>Level 2: %3%</li><li>Level 3: %4%</li>Each melody can be of different length, a melody can last %5 - %6 rounds, your <info>constitution</info> attribute influences the length of the melody.gt_info_general_textˆYou need <info>Key Cards</info> to operate the hellish elevator and access each floor.<br><br>Every %1 hours, the Hellevator goes up %2 floors, allowing you to defeat enemies on those floors again. Defeated enemies drop useful loot as well as exclusive <info>Hell Tokens</info>. Together with the <info>Hell Tokens</info> of your guild mates, you'll earn more chests full of resources. Once the Hellevator closes and the event ends, additional rewards will be credited based on the achieved guild rank.gt_tutorial_text_05àAfter the Hellevator has closed, all members of guilds that participated will receive a reward. It will depend on your guild's Hellevator rank in the game world and scales with your level. You can view at any time the rank of your guild in the Hellevator in the <info>guild rankings</info>. <br><br>You can collect your reward up to %1 days after the Hellevator has closed. It doesn't matter when you claim your reward. That reward will be determined upon closure. <br><br>The three guilds with the most Hell Tokens in a game world will also receive a <info>very special profile background</info> which lasts until the start of the next Hellevator.old_passwordOud wachtwoorddamage_multiplierDamage factorarmor_multiplierArmor factorlife_multiplierHit points factorbard_info_textñAs a Bard your damage in battle depends on your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. The melody your harp plays gives you a positive effect in battle.druid_info_textåAs a Druid your damage in battle depends on your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. The abilities of your animal forms help you in battle.bard_info_melodyMelodydealer_legal_cancellation+<link:cancellation>Annuleringsbeleid</link>battle_mage_info_comet_titleArcane Cometgt_tutorial_text_07“Be√´lzebub beloont jou en je gildeleden <info>elke dag</info> voor jullie voortgang in de Hellevator. Afhankelijk van de Hell Tokens die jullie vandaag samen hebben verdiend, krijg je van hem als beloning kisten.<br>Er zijn drie soorten kisten: <br><br><li>De vestingskist, gevuld met hout en stenen.</li><br><li>De kist van de smid, gevuld me metaal en arcane splinters.</li><br><li>De goudkist, verrassend genoeg toch echt gevuld met goud.</li><br>Kisten die in jouw afwezigheid zijn verdiend, kun je ook de volgende dag nog ophalen. In totaal kun je met je gilde %1 kisten per dag verdienen.battle_mage_info_gauntlet_titleArcane Gauntletclass_info_8"Takes the form of a bear or eagle.dot_infoÿThis is the <info>Legendary Dungeon</info>. In %1 rooms spread over %2 floors nasty monsters and treacherous traps await you, but also glorious rewards. Defeat the four bosses and receive a Legendary item at the end!dot_info_keys_textÕWhen you are in the Legendary Dungeon, you will see that some <info>locked doors</info> block your way, but don't worry. Every monster defeated in the Legendary Dungeon has a chance to have a key in their pockets.<br><br>Keys are also used as currency by the <info>Key Master</info>. With him you can trade keys for temporary blessings in the Legendary Dungeon. In contrast to this, the Key to Failure Shop Master will trade his found keys for temporary curses.dot_info_buffs_debuffs_text’As you run through the dungeon, you may receive a curse or a blessing. These are displayed <info>above your hit points bar</info> and can significantly affect your progress through the dungeon! However, they will only last for a certain number of rooms.<br><br>You can get curses and blessings in different ways, for example from <info>barrels or chests</info>. Special <info>cursed doors and chests</info> will cast a random curse on you when touched, and special rooms will also give you a curse or blessing depending on your interaction. Moreover, <info>monsters</info> from the second floor onwards can curse you with their attacks. Which curse from monsters you can suffer on which floor can be seen on the overview map.gt_daily_text‡Je hebt <info>verdieping %1</info> bereikt. Naar het gevecht!<br><br>In <info>Be√´lzebubs imperium</info> zijn er <info>nieuwe goederen</info> beschikbaar en de <info>Hell Tokens-verzamelactie</info> is <info>gereset</info>.dot_info_general_textŸYou can earn loot such as epic items, gold, or other resources by slaying monsters or opening treasure chests on %1 different floors. At the end of each floor, you‚Äôll encounter a big ol' baddie. Defeat the final boss in room %2 and receive a <info>Legendary item</info> in normal mode or <info>3 Legendary items</info> in <info>Legendary Dungeon Ultimate</info> mode. This will reset the Legendary Dungeon again so you can conquer it anew to collect more Legendary items.gt_infoÿThis is the Hellevator, an elevator that leads directly into the depths of the underworld. Fight against <info>%1 enemies of increasing strength</info> and climb up together with your guild the <info>rankings</info>.percentage_enemy_hp%1% <hp><br> of the enemydive_attack_damage_bonusSchadebonus stortvlucht: %1bard_tutorial_text_2ˆYour melody has 3 quality levels, depending on the quality level the positive effect of the melody is enhanced.<br>Chance for the respective quality levels:<br><li>Level 1: %1%</li><li>Level 2: %2%</li><li>Level 3: %3%</li>Each melody can be of different length, a melody can last %4 - %5 rounds, your <info>constitution</info> attribute influences the length of the melody.abilityAbilityitem_type_03_class_2_pic_068ãCharming Tailcoat|"Whether for a fight or a spontaneous date -<br>is guaranteed to turn the other person's head."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!armor_classArmor classweapon_classWeapon classvaluesValuesinfoInfoitem_type_09_pic_068ÑRing of Eternal Promise|"Love can't be measured in values, but this<br>bling still sparkles quite nicely!"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_07_class_1_pic_068SHeart Holder|"So that your heart doesn't sink so easily."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_1_pic_106aArmed Hands|"Who needs gloves when you<br>can use a pair of extra hands<br>to attack right away?"druid_info_shapes_textÍAs a druid, you have the ability to transform into different animal forms in battle.<br><br>Instead of a normal attack, you can quickly transform into an eagle and perform a powerful swoop (base chance %1%). Afterwards, you immediately transform back.<br><br>You also have the ability to evade attacks (%2% chance). After doing this, you transform into a bear and enter Rage. In this form you cannot evade or perform a swoop. You remain in this bear form for one round and then change back.battle_mage_info_titleThe Battle Magebattle_mage_info_textüAs a Battle Mage, your damage in battle depends on your <info>strength</info> attribute. Your training allows you to use the Arcane Gauntlet to your advantage.
max_damageMax. damagepercentage_damagePercentage damagenew_dungeon_key_found_info_textYCongratulations! You have found a key, and a new dungeon opens its massive doors for you.dungeon_18_level_12_textàAnd hello to all heroes from the famous French baguette master and Minecraft World Champion! Even drunk he does not see you as a threat.dungeon_18_level_21_textŒMoin moin, hello and welcome to your spanking. "Now you're due like animal furs" he roars triumphantly at you because with his bad puns and "like" comparisons he will beat you up like an interior decorator.all_dungeons_are_locked_titleAll dungeons are lockedall_dungeons_are_locked_textéThere are no more dungeons open at the moment. You need a dungeon key to open a dungeon:<br>See what you need to do to find more dungeon keys!dungeon_18_level_01_text!Only a true bully can defeat him!dungeon_18_level_02_textnWhile you are looking at the next tube, you catch sight of a horned opponent grinning and predicting your end.dungeon_18_level_04_texthLegend has it that his infamous hair and monkey business will be your downfall. Engage at your own risk.dungeon_18_level_06_textÑThe blue-haired guy is afraid of spiders, but since you don't have eight legs, you'll have to bite the dust! Welcome to your demise!dungeon_18_level_07_text\According to the current trend cocky heroes can be easily defeated with these clever tricks!dungeon_18_level_10_text5Unbeaten so far, but will you be able to change that?dungeon_18_level_11_textOThe best known among the unknown. Not even his shadow knows who he actually is.dungeon_18_level_16_texttRumor has it this monster was born with three legs and raised in an ashtray. Remove your socks before looking at it!dungeon_18_level_17_textRThis zebra-human hybrid loves to laugh at its own jokes and your combat challenge.dungeon_18_level_18_textuYour already square-shaped eyes haven't escaped his notice. It's inconvenient that your pause button has just broken.dungeon_18_level_20_text}Help! A computer scientist! Be careful. If he gets root access, he'll fragment you to the last bit. This opponent is NP-hard.dungeon_18_level_19_textRThe King of the Incompetent is not a king for nothing, so you'd better kneel down!bard_info_damage3The Bard's harp increases damage<br>during a fight. damage_attribute_explanation_new!= wapenschade *%3 (1 + %1 / 10)%2)damage_attribute_explanation_assassin_new$= (Schade L + R) *%3 (1 + %1 / 10)%2damage_attribute_explanation= wapenschade * (1 + %1 / 10)%2%damage_attribute_explanation_assassin*= (Schade L + R) * 0,625 * (1 + %1 / 10)%2druid_info_bear_text—In bear form you can neither evade nor perform a swoop. However, your critical hit chance and critical damage bonus are highly increased. After one round in bear form, you transform back into your normal form.character_idCharacter IDdungeon_18_level_15_textWIf you think he had a different hair color the last time you saw him, you may be right.dungeon_18_level_14_textxHe only asks one thing of you: you mustn't laugh! You think it's easy, but when you press play, he suddenly attacks you!dungeon_18_level_13_text~Dissatisfied, he raises his head above the monitor! You have interrupted his game! Suddenly the room becomes strangely square.dungeon_18_level_09_textÉHe will blind you with his perfectly shaved head, and then then blow you away with his stylish moves. You won't survive this dance!dungeon_18_level_08_textwUnderneath the thick layer of skin hides a good heart. If you bring him a packet of donuts, he might even let you pass.dungeon_18_level_05_textlStrike all you want, but he's a master of royal clashes and knows every trick to break your fighting spirit.dungeon_18_level_03_text^New technologies are on his side. Try to defeat him with your inferior equipment, if you dare!nav_mushroom_timeof %1nav_mushroom_or_hourglass_time%1 ofnav_hourglass_time%1 ofcharacter_verification_tooltip(Official Shakes & Fidget Content Creatorquest_text_location_5,Ga naar het <white>Schaduw-gebergte</white>.bard_tutorial_text_1±As a Bard, you deal your damage in combat depending on the level of your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. You also play your harp every %1 combat rounds. The melody that your harp plays gives you a positive effect in battle.<br><br>Your melody will be ineffective in fights against <info>Mages</info>!update_required_titleUpdate requiredupdate_required_text§Please update the app as it is not possible to continue playing without an update.<br><br>Would you like to download the update now?<br><br>This will close the app!update_recommended_text{A new update is ready for you to install.<br><br>Would you like to download the update now?<br><br>This will close the app!update_recommended_titelUpdate possibledruid_info_eagle_textëThe eagle form gives you the chance to land a swoop attack instead of a normal attack, dealing a lot of damage. Each swoop increases this chance.druid_info_shapes_titleShapeshiftingdruid_info_eagle_titleSwoop of the Eagle
max_chanceMaximum chance: %1bard_instrument_title&Harp: melodie van doorzettingsvermogendruid_info_bear_titleBear in Ragedruid_info_crittThe Druid's Bear Form affects<br>the maximum critical hit chance in fights<br>and the damage bonus of critical hits.dive_attack_chance_increaseChance increase: %1bard_instrument_2_text-Verhoogt de <info>schade van je wapen</info>.dot_misc_wizard_15You hear vicious growling.dot_boss_38_Helps such poor unfortunate souls like you quite unselfishly as long as you pay with your life!dot_monster_wizard_87Hopefully, you've perfected the swish and flick by now?monster_name_6069Natural Narcissistspet_requirements_water_19XCan be found on a<br>quest in the Busted Lands<br>after clearing the 22nd Light Dungeon.pet_requirements_light_19KCan be found on a<br>quest in the Rotten Lands<br>after clearing the Tower.pet_requirements_fire_19LCan be found on a<br>quest on Skull Island after<br>clearing Demon's Portal.pet_requirements_shadow_19hCan be found in the Plains of Oz'Korr<br>after clearing floor 10 of the<br>15th dungeon in Shadow World.tower_bonus_info+%1% gold bonus (quests)tower_explanationÂ100 floors are waiting for you to climb them.<br><br>For each floor you defeat, you will receive a permanent bonus of +1% gold for quests.<br><br>After completing the 100th floor, you will receive a permanent bonus of +100% gold!monster_name_5236Ice-cold Morticianmonster_name_5237 Uschi, Contract Mage of the Seasmonster_name_5238Shadow Witch of Crossbowsmonster_name_5239Baba Yaga's Holiday Hutmonster_name_5230Gargling Cauldronmonster_name_5231Ultrasensitive Unicorn Dummymonster_name_5232One-legged Assistantmonster_name_5233Magical Kittymonster_name_5234Sharp-tongued Marsh Toadmonster_name_5235Clamoring Mandrakeitem_type_09_pic_106nBaba Yaga's Cursed Claw Ring|"Upset clucking didn't help here, but this<br>ring will serve you well. BA-GAWK!"item_type_03_class_1_pic_106bUschi's Kraken Dress|"For the most graceful locomotion both on<br>land and on the deepest seabed."gt_greed_1_titlePlain of Blind Greedgt_greed_1_desc∞Many a person has voluntarily thrown themselves into the lava flow of molten gold here. Alternatively, you can go and break your neck jumping into the glittering pool of coins.gt_gluttony_2_titlePlain of Palatable Booze-houndsgt_gluttony_2_descõThe music is so loud here that you have to yell and belch in each other's ears and still understand nothing. Besides, everything seems to be spinning here.monster_name_6076Crusty Crustaceanmonster_name_6077Furry She-Devilmonster_name_6065Filterless Natural Beautymonster_name_6066Power-hungry Regentmonster_name_6067Brutal Brokermonster_name_6068Greedy Gold Divermonster_name_6070The Deluded Richmonster_name_6071
Vain Elitemonster_name_6072Ruthless Collectorsmonster_name_6073Haughty Hoardersmonster_name_6074Greedy Groupmonster_name_6075Powerful Packalbum_ach_067_textAStart December 6th without shoes. Put them in the inventory, e.g.dot_misc_wizard_6CAre you wrong or did the portrait just stick its tongue out at you?dot_boss_37BShe always has several cold hands ready for your colorless demise.dot_boss_39\Choose your death: strangled by hair, pierced by arrows or rather crushed by a demonic foot?dot_boss_40uCuckoo knows why this hut bares its teeth hungrily at the sight of you. Make sure it makes its last chirp right away!dot_monster_wizard_6.Abracadabra! But will you get ahead unscathed?dot_monster_wizard_7How good are you at apparating?dot_monster_wizard_9AIf you master sleight of hand, this is the wrong audience for it.dot_monster_wizard_10-Can perhaps be bribed with a chocolate bunny?dot_misc_wizard_100Something is clucking and cooing here, isn't it?dot_misc_wizard_7FPicking your nose is not recommended with all those eyes watching you.dot_misc_wizard_8-The screaming mandrakes make your ears bleed.dot_misc_wizard_9AA chant of words you have never heard before pierces the silence.dot_misc_wizard_11QJudging by the smell of sulfur, some eggs from last year have not been found yet.dot_misc_wizard_12$Is something boiling over somewhere?dot_misc_wizard_13=Sounds like sharp fingernails slowly scratching a chalkboard.dot_misc_wizard_14&Is someone nibbling on a child's bone?dot_misc_wizard_167Hysterical female laughter echoes through the corridor.dot_misc_wizard_17:Throbbing and knocking can be heard from some Easter eggs.dot_misc_wizard_188Hissing, a scaled reptile is slithering along your feet.dot_misc_wizard_19?Is anyone sweeping? The dusty corridors are in dire need of it.dot_misc_wizard_208A soothing flute melody makes your eyelids feel heavier.dot_misc_wizard_21=Because of the permanent hocus-pocus, you start seeing stars.dot_misc_wizard_3IBetter close your mouth or you'll end up swallowing the flying gold ball!dot_intro_easter°On this year's quest for the magical Legendaries you have ended up in the enchanted forest. Fight your way through cursed branches and defeat the powerful coven!item_type_09_pic_105AElven Ring|"Not THE ring, but you hereby<br>become its sidekick."item_type_06_class_1_pic_105jSun Helmet|"This practical helmet not only<br>blinds your opponent, but pokes<br>his eyes out right away!"item_type_10_pic_105bUseless Sword|"Transforms into a handy key<br>for your new home with just<br>a few drops of blood.gt_visual_rewardlEveryone in your guild receives a character background <portraitbg>. It will last until the next Hellevator.payment_in_progress_alreadyUAnother payment process is already in progress.<br>Please wait until it is completed.event_description_valentineS<li>Chance of amorous epic items in the weapon shop, magic shop and for quests</li>worldWerelddump_allDump allitem_type_11_pic_043;Flying Key|"To catch him, you must get on your broom first"dungeon_26_commentG‚ÄûTelkens als er een van hen ontsnapt, staat er een<br>stad in brand."dungeon_19_commentTBifr√∂st krijgt kippenvel bij de gedachte<br>dat je door Ragnar√∂k wordt vermorzeld.dot_reward_textOYou have found one item. Decide what you want to do with it before you move on. event_description_epic_adventurew<li>You will receive an epic item each for completing the second adventure after drinking the first and tenth beer</li>starterpack_9_christmas_titleChristmas Elf Packitem_type_10_pic_068WSweet Temptation|"Give it away or tearfully eat it yourself."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!dot_mode_selection_textQThe choice is yours!<br>Choose a Legendary Dungeon mode and grab Legendary items!item_type_07_class_3_pic_068>Heart Cord|"Become a gift yourself."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!claim_legendary_rewards_textRHey scatterbrain! Don't forget to claim your Legendary items before it's too late!"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_2[<li><info>3x the amount of resources</info></li><li><info>3x the amount of gold</info></li>monster_name_5218Christmas Trollmonster_name_5219
